Icons in this directory are derived from Material Design Icons
(https://pictogrammers.com/library/mdi/), provided by Pictogrammers under the
Apache License 2.0 (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

The SVG files are generated as 24x24 fill-only symbols with a `pt-` prefix so
they are always resolved from this app instead of the desktop icon theme.
